(************************************************************
 *                                IMITATOR MODEL
 *
 * Title            : Very simple example to test the absence of invariants in AF
 * Description      : Very simple example to test the absence of invariants in AF
 * Correctness      : AF accepting
 * Scalable         : no
 * Generated        : no
 * Categories       : N/A
 * Source           : Own work
 * bibkey           :
 * Author           : Étienne André
 * Modeling         : N/A
 * Input by         : Étienne André
